    "Details": "The -2E was trialed as a medium range juggernaut, using an all energy loadout of four Snubnose PPC and four Large Pulse Lasers. A single head mounted Small Laser provide anti-infantry defenses. The Pulse Lasers are mounted with Laser Insulators, lowering their heat generation considerably.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Superheavy Prototype</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.39</color></b>",
